        <p>OLYMPIA, LIVER:</p>
        <p>On August 10th, at Olympia, Lire,rl3 Frank Allen, the managing director, 19 ing Sir Herbert Beerbohm Tree's re duction, from His Majesty's Theat's:t "Joseph and His Brethren." 13' r duction will be on a more elaborate 3 tious scale; as, for the purposes effect, there will he many more suPerili,o- and scenic detail than could have „."—i in a theatre so large as that where inally produced. Mr. Louis N. 1111-] author, will personally control the re, while Mr. Alfred Denville, who so suoc. gave us the wonderful spectacle Miracle," will again be responsible ' whole spectacle.</p>
