        <p>Over-mastering Power."</p>
        <p>rea, egritain, France, Belgium, Russia and Servia are now at war with Germany and Austria-Hungary. reached is told briefly below.</p>
        <p>WAR IS DECLARED.</p>
        <p>/rantatie Message at Midnight.</p>
        <p>ta• ;In declaration of war on Germany 41 a dramatic manner at midnight on ••r• At 12.15 a.m. the following message -sued on behalf of the Government :</p>
        <p>Upwin9 to the summary rejection by the ,th_an Government of the request made by s majesty's Government for assurances that s neutrality of Belgium waild be respected, Majesty's Ambassador in Berlin • has ;Iverd his passports, and His Majesty's I,ernnlent has declared to the German Gov- ent that a State of War exists between It Britain and Germany as from 11 p.m. "n9ust 4th.</p>
        <p>Immense Combination Against "a Strong and</p>
        <p>THE WAR.</p>
        <p>How the crisis has been</p>
        <p>Belgium Provide a Surprise for the Germans.</p>
        <p>FLANKING MOVEMENT DELAYED.</p>
        <p>Germany is developing a heavy attack through South-Eastern Belgium, with the obvious aim of breaking through the left flank of France's frontier defences. The large force engaged is variously estimated at from 80,000 .to 120,000 men. Mention is made of the Sixth, the Seventh, and the Tenth Army Corps, which at</p>
