        <p>Played at Warrin-gton on Monday. Scores : Warrington.—J. Thompson eC. Lanceley b T. Lanceley 5, IT. Partridge h C. Lanceley 1, T. Williamson c Lovesay b J. Birch 6, W. V. mi._ ton c Dodd b T. Lancele3*29, G. Whitlow 13 T. Lanceley 7, W. H. Bell b T. Lanceley 0, J. Mclntyre st Vernon b T. Lanceley 2, A. D. Heys c Dodd b T. Lanceley 6, J. Hannam b T. Lance- ley 8, W, Bennett c Ritchie b T. Lanceley 5, A. Holbrook not out 2, extras 1; total 72. Barrow.—T. Lanceley c Heys b Bell 7, A. Ellis b Bennett 3, 11. Birch c Holbrook b Bell 10, C. Lanceley c Mclntyre h Bennett 0. J. Birch st Holbrook b Bennett 2, F. Dodd h Bell 0, W. Vernon c Hannam. b Bennett 5, J. Ritchie c Holbrook b Bell 3, B. Lovesay b Bennett 3, C. Hawkins not out 0, R. Garner h Bell 0, extras 2; total 35.</p>
        <p>Cairo-street Unitarians 2nd V. Rylands' 2nd. At Gorsey-lane on Monday. Scores : Cairo-street.—J. Bailey b Richardsofi 6, A. H. Mather b Wadsworth 2, A. Ellsmore c Bvram 13 Richardson 3, A. Forbes not out 8, J. Hilliara Byram b Wadsworth 11, W. Hankinson run out 2, E. Whittaker b Wadsworth 0, E. Trickie c Holt b Richardson 0, J. Moore h Richardson 0, R. Mellor c Byrom h Wadsworth 0, extras 2; total 25.</p>
